      "cooked": "<p>Christopher and Adam provide an update.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/spine-a-sode\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/spine-a-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1808c31e9ba7e93eabb92233c20d2d90b9f58215.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/spine-a-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Spine-a-sode!</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Another fake episode? You bet! But this one has way more information than last fake episode, hippo violations be damned! Plus, hope for an eventual return to normalcy! What more could you ask for? Thanks for sticking with us, folks. We hate not...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
