      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-02-07T03:58:19.180Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Glad to hear there’s better information now and a plan for treatment and recovery. Still take it easy and don’t push too hard to jump right back in.</p>\n<p>At the risk of crossing a line I’ll quote Boba Fett saying “He’s no good to me dead.”</p>\n<p>Seriously, though… Sending good vibes for a swift positive resolution and relief from a feeling I can’t even imagine. Is there a Dr. Medico, M.D. in the house? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/hospital.png?v=12\" title=\":hospital:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":hospital:\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/man_health_worker/2.png?v=12\" title=\":man_health_worker:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_health_worker:t2:\"></p>",
